{#if type==='favor'}
 <section class="favor-track"><p class="eyebrow">HIGHER POWERS · PLAYER __________________</p><h2>Divine Favor</h2><p>Move a coin along this track. Favor never decreases.</p><div class="favor-numbers">{#each Array.from({length:31},(_,i)=>i) as n}<span>{n}</span>{/each}</div><p class="track-note">For 31+: reuse the track and write +30 beside your name.<br/>Draw allowance = players minus other players with equal or higher Favor. Ties take the lower allowance.</p></section>
